WEBVTT

00:39.998 --> 00:41.332
It's morning...

00:42.334 --> 00:44.002
What a wonderful dream.

00:51.217 --> 00:54.929
No better dream
than a nightmare.

00:57.057 --> 00:58.808
<i>I see it...</i>

00:59.809 --> 01:02.979
<i>I see your pain, as well...</i>

01:04.064 --> 01:07.942
<i>You win, Jugo.</i>

01:09.027 --> 01:12.238
I also see your loyalty...

01:12.822 --> 01:16.701
My son born of darkness.

01:19.037 --> 01:20.372
<i>Come...</i>

01:23.166 --> 01:26.920
<i>No one can stop me.</i>

01:31.091 --> 01:35.011
THE CALAMITY

01:36.846 --> 01:39.390
<i>I've lived my way full of shame</i>

01:39.391 --> 01:43.811
<i>"Envy" comes from the ways
of the eventual end</i>

01:43.812 --> 01:46.355
<i>The ambiguous balance</i>

01:46.356 --> 01:49.109
<i>I want to cut ties at once</i>

01:50.276 --> 01:52.027
<i>It's too late to back down now</i>

01:52.028 --> 01:53.278
<i>Before this senile body dies</i>

01:53.279 --> 01:55.030
<i>My shadow will fade away soon, but</i>

01:55.031 --> 01:57.241
<i>Even if I disappear, my journey won't stop</i>

01:57.242 --> 01:58.742
<i>Uncertain days, certain endings</i>

01:58.743 --> 02:00.619
<i>My stories fill the in-betweens</i>

02:00.620 --> 02:03.163
<i>Beyond the wall blocking my way,
there is a calm morning</i>

02:03.164 --> 02:07.419
<i>Like the rising sun,
I stand with the wind at my back</i>

02:07.544 --> 02:11.588
<i>A burst of hope?</i>

02:11.589 --> 02:14.174
<i>Break through an endless night</i>

02:14.175 --> 02:18.887
<i>Show the sun waiting
at the end of darkness</i>

02:18.888 --> 02:22.433
<i>The promise is yet to be fulfilled</i>

02:22.434 --> 02:25.602
<i>but I stand in solitude not to let it go</i>

02:25.603 --> 02:28.439
<i>At the moment,
I'm connecting numerous lights</i>

02:28.440 --> 02:32.152
<i>to form a constellation that paves
tomorrow</i>

02:32.610 --> 02:36.697
<i>Even if the rain clouds
hide the night sky away</i>

02:36.698 --> 02:40.117
<i>there certainly is a flame in my heart</i>

02:40.118 --> 02:45.331
<i>God is no longer reliable</i>

02:45.498 --> 02:50.169
<i>I glance up towards the silver lining</i>

02:50.170 --> 02:56.468
<i>The destiny of bursting fate</i>

02:56.634 --> 02:59.012
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

03:44.391 --> 03:48.770
Their powers switch only
while Yhwach is asleep.

03:49.813 --> 03:50.647
That's right.

03:51.147 --> 03:54.234
Right now, Yhwach does not
have the power of The Almighty.

03:54.776 --> 03:57.237
He's now in
the upper level of Wahr Welt.

03:57.654 --> 03:59.155
Head up there, Kurosaki!

03:59.656 --> 04:00.740
Ishida!

04:01.408 --> 04:03.785
Are you actually gonna stay here?

04:03.952 --> 04:07.162
If he has Yhwach's powers,
then it's all the more reason-!

04:07.163 --> 04:09.624
Quit talking and go!

04:11.126 --> 04:13.128
Besides, those won't be my last words.

04:39.988 --> 04:41.614
Is everything okay, Inoue?

04:41.948 --> 04:44.325
I'm fine.
I'm okay.

04:44.868 --> 04:48.288
I just... kinda felt relieved.

04:48.455 --> 04:49.456
Relieved?

04:51.833 --> 04:53.043
How do I put it?

04:53.543 --> 04:58.923
I never believed Ishida
actually joined the Quincy, but...

05:00.175 --> 05:04.804
hearing him say it directly
was a relief, I guess.

05:06.181 --> 05:10.769
I was just thinking
Ishida was still the same Ishida...

05:14.147 --> 05:15.148
What's that?!

05:33.166 --> 05:34.709
- Chad!
- Sado!

05:35.043 --> 05:37.045
I'm okay.
Just go!

05:44.594 --> 05:46.805
Okay...
Let's do this.

05:48.098 --> 05:50.225
Turn to sand!

05:52.018 --> 05:53.019
Oh, it's you, Ganju.

05:53.353 --> 05:54.354
Where've you been?

05:54.562 --> 05:56.563
"Where've you been?" my butt!

05:56.564 --> 05:58.608
You left me
and went off on your own!

05:59.067 --> 06:01.151
I got separated and got lost!

06:01.152 --> 06:04.656
That's when I saw this perfect
moment to use my skills.

06:04.864 --> 06:07.241
A group of stone statues
is perfect!

06:07.242 --> 06:10.036
My Seppa was made for this!

06:10.245 --> 06:11.329
Hey, listen to me!

06:11.871 --> 06:14.081
- I'm listening.
- Are you really, though?

06:14.082 --> 06:16.876
Give me a reaction or something!

06:18.753 --> 06:21.631
Do you like doing
unglamourous work, Ganju?

06:24.342 --> 06:27.178
Ichigo only sees the path
that's in front of him.

06:27.595 --> 06:28.805
That's how he is.

06:29.681 --> 06:36.396
Our job is to clean out the castle
and pave a path back for Ichigo.

06:52.579 --> 06:56.207
<i>Haschwalth can't see
the complete future...</i>

06:57.125 --> 06:59.627
<i>You surprise me, Uryu Ishida.</i>

07:00.128 --> 07:02.505
<i>You look completely different
from who you were earlier.</i>

07:03.256 --> 07:07.093
<i>You seem so full of hope now.</i>

07:07.469 --> 07:08.428
<i>I see.</i>

07:09.054 --> 07:12.682
<i>Setting aside whether or not
I am full of hope or not,</i>

07:13.391 --> 07:15.727
<i>the fact that you're surprised...</i>

07:16.269 --> 07:20.440
<i>...means you did not foresee me
being filled with hope, did you?</i>

07:22.609 --> 07:26.488
<i>At that time,
he didn't confirm or deny it.</i>

07:32.118 --> 07:36.498
Like I keep telling you,
I see everything.

07:44.714 --> 07:49.052
<i>In that case, I'll just confirm
how much you can see.</i>

08:09.072 --> 08:10.198
<i>They're not hitting him...!</i>

08:10.365 --> 08:12.367
<i>So, he can see everything,
after all?</i>

08:19.165 --> 08:22.167
Seems you're limiting
my angles of attack

08:22.168 --> 08:24.838
by standing with your back
to the walls and ceiling.

08:25.296 --> 08:28.174
Then you need only to concentrate
on what's in front of you.

08:28.717 --> 08:32.762
I praise you for fighting
a cerebral battle, Uryu Ishida.

08:33.304 --> 08:36.224
As I'd expect from you,
Grand Master.

08:36.349 --> 08:39.477
But I don't appreciate your praise.

08:51.573 --> 08:53.992
Your life is in my hands...

09:10.884 --> 09:14.637
Right now, the power of
His Majesty fills my body,

09:15.013 --> 09:18.099
Trying to take these powers
from me is futile.

09:19.726 --> 09:21.143
Uryu Ishida...

09:21.144 --> 09:23.104
You cannot be me.

09:23.688 --> 09:25.565
I am His Majesty's other half.

09:25.857 --> 09:28.902
I am a Quincy born to be together
with His Majesty.

09:29.778 --> 09:33.948
That is why His Majesty entrusted his
powers to me.

09:36.534 --> 09:37.786
Can you see it?

09:37.994 --> 09:40.121
Can you see what is
about to happen next?

09:44.292 --> 09:46.336
What is that?!

09:47.629 --> 09:49.839
This is His Majesty's true wish.

09:51.800 --> 09:53.176
It's a hit!

09:53.426 --> 09:57.055
Jinta Home-Run!

10:01.101 --> 10:04.354
Uh...
What is that huge crack?!

10:05.230 --> 10:08.733
It's identical to that "distortion"
Kisuke was investigating...

10:09.442 --> 10:10.818
Wait a minute!!

10:10.819 --> 10:13.780
A "distortion" is a concentration
of dangerous energy...

10:13.988 --> 10:16.574
I thought the Manager
and the others fixed it!

10:16.950 --> 10:19.285
He was supposed to, but...

10:19.619 --> 10:23.957
Isn't it dangerous to stay in
this town... or even in this world?

10:24.082 --> 10:25.417
Isn't that right, Tessai?

10:27.002 --> 10:28.003
<i>Mr. Urahara...</i>

10:31.464 --> 10:33.133
Did you say, his true wish?

10:33.925 --> 10:36.636
Everything is proceeding according
to His Majesty's plan

10:37.137 --> 10:40.056
that began with the attack
on Soul Society.

10:41.057 --> 10:42.891
The extermination of
massive numbers of Hollows

10:42.892 --> 10:44.059
from the World of the Living

10:44.060 --> 10:46.354
greatly upset the balance of souls

10:47.230 --> 10:50.942
Our invasion fooled
many Soul Reapers.

10:51.609 --> 10:53.193
The deaths of Genryusai Yamamoto

10:53.194 --> 10:55.739
followed by members of Squad Zero

10:56.197 --> 11:00.660
upset the balance
in this world to its core.

11:01.244 --> 11:04.288
And the Soul King, who was
the lynchpin of the Three Worlds,

11:04.289 --> 11:06.416
became a part of
His Majesty's power.

11:07.625 --> 11:09.209
This rift is a prelude

11:09.210 --> 11:12.005
to the annihilation
of the Three Worlds.

11:12.630 --> 11:14.341
Annihilation of the entire world...

11:16.509 --> 11:18.595
What are you trying to do?

11:18.970 --> 11:20.930
You've probably
heard before.

11:21.931 --> 11:22.932
It's called "Welt."

11:25.101 --> 11:27.062
We are creating a new world.

11:28.063 --> 11:29.773
We will destroy the Three Worlds

11:29.898 --> 11:33.485
to create a monarchy
of and for Quincy.

11:34.110 --> 11:36.154
That is His Majesty's true wish

11:36.488 --> 11:40.116
and it is the duty Stern Ritter
must fulfill for their brethren.

11:42.035 --> 11:45.914
You are not a part of that future
that I see.

11:49.209 --> 11:51.336
Dealing with traitors...

11:53.088 --> 11:54.631
...is also my job!

12:03.973 --> 12:07.060
Spoken like
His Majesty's mouthpiece.

12:09.270 --> 12:13.358
After hearing what you said,
my to-do list just grew.

12:14.192 --> 12:18.530
First, defeat you to eliminate
The Almighty.

12:19.531 --> 12:25.704
Second, eliminate this rift
and protect the Three Worlds.

12:46.391 --> 12:49.561
Can't believe
I didn't have to move...

12:57.193 --> 12:59.237
...to survive all that!

13:00.113 --> 13:04.534
I feel it. I feel myself moving
farther away from death.

13:05.201 --> 13:09.289
If my immunity is the ultimate way
to avoid death,

13:09.622 --> 13:12.584
maybe I have immunity to
thank for this as well.

13:13.877 --> 13:15.503
What do you think,

13:16.087 --> 13:18.006
Yoruichi Shihoin?

13:19.841 --> 13:24.554
Sorry, I thought you were talking
to yourself, so I wasn't listening.

13:25.055 --> 13:27.849
More like you
couldn't listen, right?

13:28.308 --> 13:30.517
I fired off a hybrid Gift Ball

13:30.518 --> 13:33.188
of Spiritual Pressure,
Oxygen, and Nitrogen.

13:33.772 --> 13:37.150
You didn't have the luxury of
listening to pointless mutterings...

13:37.734 --> 13:42.947
Honestly, I'm surprised
you're not dead in your condition.

13:43.281 --> 13:44.240
Likewise...

13:44.783 --> 13:47.327
After all that fiddling
with fatal dosage...

13:47.869 --> 13:53.833
I'm not sure why you adjusted it
enough to keep me barely alive.

13:54.084 --> 13:55.876
You're wrong.

13:55.877 --> 13:58.004
I did the best that I could.

13:58.546 --> 14:01.049
Anyone else would have
been dead by now.

14:02.884 --> 14:05.553
Stop ignoring that you're a freak

14:05.804 --> 14:09.182
and making it sound like
I went easy on you.

14:09.766 --> 14:11.101
It's a real bummer.

14:18.817 --> 14:21.569
<i>Yushiro won't last much longer...</i>

14:22.237 --> 14:25.782
<i>But I don't have the strength
to heal him in my condition.</i>

14:27.367 --> 14:28.326
<i>In that case!</i>

14:28.993 --> 14:29.869
Don't bother.

14:31.454 --> 14:33.915
I don't know what you're up to...

14:34.249 --> 14:36.542
You didn't react when I got this close,

14:36.543 --> 14:38.795
you're at death's door.

14:40.630 --> 14:42.715
No matter what you try
in the state you're in now,

14:42.716 --> 14:45.176
I'm confident I can strike first.

14:45.844 --> 14:51.015
That's pretty fatal,
don't you think, Yoruichi Shihoin?

14:51.016 --> 14:51.850
Indeed!

14:52.767 --> 14:55.145
You've been dealt
a fatal wedgie, Yoruichi.

14:55.687 --> 14:56.771
That hurt my chin!

14:57.022 --> 15:00.024
I came all this way to save you.
Why'd you kick me?!

15:00.025 --> 15:01.901
What made you think I wouldn't?!

15:02.193 --> 15:04.279
Look at me!
Stop staring at my butt!

15:04.946 --> 15:06.280
Sorry...

15:06.281 --> 15:09.783
You're right.
Perhaps "wedgie" was a bit vulgar.

15:09.784 --> 15:11.494
That's not why I kicked you!

15:11.619 --> 15:13.413
And stop touching my butt
while apologizing!

15:13.747 --> 15:15.539
Kisuke Urahara...

15:15.540 --> 15:18.084
Another troublemaker
to deal with...

15:18.835 --> 15:22.297
Oh, you know me?
Much obliged.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.173
"Do I know you?!"

15:24.174 --> 15:25.924
You may not know this,

15:25.925 --> 15:28.469
but you're one
of the Special Threats

15:28.470 --> 15:30.180
designated personally
by His Majesty.

15:30.805 --> 15:35.060
I'm honored to be included
among such esteemed company.

15:35.643 --> 15:37.896
It's a privilege, but he's
giving me too much credit.

15:38.855 --> 15:40.982
Isn't that right, Yoruichi?

15:44.152 --> 15:45.320
What?!

15:47.655 --> 15:49.157
<i>What did he do?</i>

15:49.532 --> 15:51.826
<i>How is Yoruichi Shihoin
able to move?!</i>

15:51.951 --> 15:54.037
<i>Did he undo my Death Dealing?!</i>

15:54.454 --> 15:55.622
<i>How?!</i>

15:57.957 --> 16:00.919
<i>No, this is exactly
what I've been told about.</i>

16:01.670 --> 16:03.212
<i>The five Special Threats
were chosen</i>

16:03.213 --> 16:04.881
<i>for their incalculable aspects.</i>

16:05.382 --> 16:07.676
<i>Ichigo Kurosaki
for his "potential."</i>

16:08.301 --> 16:10.553
<i>Kenpachi Zaraki
for his "combat strength."</i>

16:10.845 --> 16:13.056
<i>Ichibei Hyosube for his "wisdom."</i>

16:13.515 --> 16:15.809
<i>Sosuke Aizen
for his "Spiritual Pressure."</i>

16:16.685 --> 16:19.019
<i>And Kisuke Urahara</i>

16:19.020 --> 16:20.855
<i>for his "incalculable tricks!"</i>

16:21.356 --> 16:23.774
<i>Regardless of what strategy
you use,</i>

16:23.775 --> 16:25.859
<i>he will always outsmart you.</i>

16:25.860 --> 16:28.405
<i>He is the consummate schemer!</i>

16:29.197 --> 16:32.574
<i>Man... Why am I the one</i>

16:32.575 --> 16:35.370
<i>who always has to face
these troublemakers?!</i>

16:42.377 --> 16:44.170
What did you inject into my butt?

16:45.880 --> 16:46.881
It's a secret.

16:47.424 --> 16:50.342
An immunity enhancing
agent you cooked up

16:50.343 --> 16:51.885
while hiding
and eavesdropping on us...

16:51.886 --> 16:53.762
Am I right?

16:53.763 --> 16:55.222
As expected, Yoruichi!

16:55.223 --> 16:56.725
How astute of you.

16:56.850 --> 16:59.935
I had to rush and improvise,
so its effect won't last long.

16:59.936 --> 17:00.937
How long?

17:01.813 --> 17:03.440
About 5 minutes, maybe?

17:04.024 --> 17:04.858
That's plenty!

17:05.275 --> 17:06.317
Shunko!

17:07.027 --> 17:09.362
- Raijin Senkei...
- Hold on, Yoruichi.

17:09.946 --> 17:11.906
What?!
You got more to say?!

17:12.657 --> 17:13.950
Let's try that thing...

17:14.492 --> 17:15.493
No!

17:15.785 --> 17:17.786
Why'd you shoot me down so quick?

17:17.787 --> 17:21.207
Let me try to explain and
negotiate with you...

17:21.833 --> 17:25.795
I never want to be that half-assed,
grotesque form ever again!

17:26.254 --> 17:28.423
I see...
Too bad.

17:29.007 --> 17:31.426
I don't want to do this,
but you force my hand...

17:34.429 --> 17:36.473
Oops! Bummer.
I missed.

17:40.852 --> 17:42.020
Hey...

17:42.562 --> 17:44.855
It's nice that you're able to move,

17:44.856 --> 17:46.816
and it's great
you're excited, but...

17:51.738 --> 17:55.200
I hit you with the Gift Ball when
you were in perfect condition...

17:55.492 --> 17:57.409
Do you really think you can beat me

17:57.410 --> 18:00.789
just because you
recovered a little bit?

18:03.416 --> 18:05.085
Yoruichi!

18:08.254 --> 18:10.548
WHEN I TURN THIS PAGE
YOU WILL TRANSFORM

18:19.140 --> 18:21.351
<i>What just happened?!</i>

18:29.901 --> 18:32.904
W-What kind of form is that?!

18:35.865 --> 18:38.618
Hey, don't ignore me!

18:39.369 --> 18:43.707
Shunko: Raiju Senkei
Shunryu Kokubyo Senki.

18:44.416 --> 18:45.250
That's what.

18:46.418 --> 18:50.380
Okay, but why are you
the one saying it?

18:52.549 --> 18:54.175
<i>Could it be?</i>

18:54.676 --> 18:57.470
<i>Can she not understand
what I'm saying right now?</i>

19:08.606 --> 19:10.233
No way!

19:18.992 --> 19:20.159
How is this happening?

19:20.160 --> 19:23.455
I should be immune to
her Spiritual Pressure already!

19:23.705 --> 19:25.914
It's not possible for
a Soul Reaper's Spiritual Pressure

19:25.915 --> 19:27.125
to change midway like this!

19:27.459 --> 19:28.960
What's going on?!

19:29.127 --> 19:30.420
She's moody.

19:31.379 --> 19:33.965
You know how they say
cats can be fickle?

19:34.507 --> 19:36.718
Yoruichi's moods
in her Kokubyo Senki form

19:36.843 --> 19:38.762
shows in her Spiritual Pressure.

19:39.095 --> 19:41.765
See how she's not coming
after you right now?

19:41.890 --> 19:43.641
It's because she's not in the mood.

19:44.142 --> 19:49.856
Yoruichi's moody to begin with,
but in that form,

19:49.981 --> 19:54.194
her Spiritual Pressure becomes
more erratic.

19:55.528 --> 19:58.156
It's almost like
someone else's Spiritual Pressure.

20:01.659 --> 20:03.953
You know how the flu
spreads every year?

20:04.829 --> 20:06.246
Even if it's not a new strain,

20:06.247 --> 20:08.499
just a tiny mutation
in antigenicity

20:08.500 --> 20:11.002
and last year's strain Type A
spreads again.

20:11.419 --> 20:12.962
It's sort of like that.

20:13.463 --> 20:15.840
Even if your body keeps
building up immunity,

20:16.091 --> 20:18.510
one small change
makes it all for nothing.

20:19.552 --> 20:22.805
Sure, your immunity
acquisition rate

20:22.806 --> 20:24.849
is incredibly fast...

20:25.558 --> 20:27.685
When you're attacked,

20:27.686 --> 20:29.812
you reflexively analyze
the Spiritual Pressure

20:29.813 --> 20:32.816
and build immunity
at a terrifying speed.

20:34.025 --> 20:37.529
It takes you just a minute
to nullify any attack.

20:38.196 --> 20:39.989
But that's not fast enough.

20:40.448 --> 20:42.950
The Spiritual Pressure when
Yoruichi's in Kokubyo Senki

20:42.951 --> 20:45.829
changes 48 times per second.

21:07.600 --> 21:08.435
Hey!

21:10.854 --> 21:13.940
Yoruichi...
I have Yoru-nip for you.

21:14.524 --> 21:15.817
Come here.

21:18.695 --> 21:19.612
Ouch!

21:27.579 --> 21:29.122
Okay, okay!

21:30.248 --> 21:31.082
Oh boy...

21:31.624 --> 21:33.584
I'm the only one
who can control her,

21:33.585 --> 21:36.045
and she can only revert back
if she's in the mood...

21:36.046 --> 21:37.714
I guess that's the drawback
with this form.

21:38.381 --> 21:42.344
Well, Yoruichi in this form is cute
in her own way,

21:42.635 --> 21:44.721
so I don't really mind.

21:45.388 --> 21:48.224
Oh, it's been almost five minutes.

21:48.725 --> 21:51.061
The immuno enhancer
is about to wear off.

21:51.519 --> 21:53.229
You did well, Yoruichi.

21:53.938 --> 21:55.940
Take your time detoxing
from the poison.

21:56.941 --> 21:58.734
I'm going to look for his body

21:58.735 --> 22:00.195
and make sure he's dead.

22:10.914 --> 22:12.499
What the hell is this?

22:13.750 --> 22:15.377
A Gift Ball Deluxe.

22:16.586 --> 22:19.214
The largest Gift Ball I can create.

22:19.798 --> 22:22.884
Oh! That's not
what's bothering you?

22:23.259 --> 22:25.762
Are you bothered
by the way I look?

22:26.221 --> 22:28.264
It's called Hass Hein.

22:29.015 --> 22:31.142
Not that cool of a name, right?

22:35.522 --> 22:36.689
<i>Retracing memories</i>

22:36.690 --> 22:40.526
<i>An unexpected gaze</i>

22:40.527 --> 22:43.028
<i>The world I didn't want</i>

22:43.029 --> 22:45.155
<i>I've started breaking it down</i>

22:45.156 --> 22:47.616
<i>Lean on each other and face forward</i>

22:47.617 --> 22:50.369
<i>I want to change my fate</i>

22:50.370 --> 22:53.664
<i>All the voices shout</i>

22:53.665 --> 22:55.667
<i>The sound rang out</i>

23:11.099 --> 23:13.642
<i>I saw countless scattered shadows</i>

23:13.643 --> 23:15.979
<i>and I laughed</i>

23:16.146 --> 23:18.439
<i>A world that's lost its color</i>

23:18.440 --> 23:20.816
<i>I'll illuminate it again</i>

23:20.817 --> 23:23.485
<i>Broken and lamenting</i>

23:23.486 --> 23:26.113
<i>The end of the dream</i>

23:26.114 --> 23:30.576
<i>Shaking free from it over and over again
with a still-connected heart</i>

23:30.577 --> 23:36.081
<i>I'll protect today,
the path I've walked all this time</i>

23:36.082 --> 23:37.334
<i>Break it</i>

23:37.500 --> 23:39.960
<i>Tear the future apart, call my name</i>

23:39.961 --> 23:42.963
<i>Turn your back on your predetermined past</i>

23:42.964 --> 23:45.549
<i>Today keeps playing with fate</i>

23:45.550 --> 23:47.885
<i>Reclaim it here and now</i>

23:47.886 --> 23:50.429
<i>To the ends of the earth, an unseen dream</i>

23:50.430 --> 23:53.182
<i>With eyes that know the strength
that lies in words</i>

23:53.183 --> 23:56.310
<i>Notice the distorted spiral</i>

23:56.311 --> 23:59.814
<i>My fate has been set in motion</i>

24:09.574 --> 24:11.618
<i>Sickeningly poisonous...</i>

24:13.119 --> 24:16.056
<i>Doesn't it make you dizzy?</i>
